# Talking-head is Dreamina

If the user asks to generate a talking-head / 口播 / 我的形象 / 数字人 / presenter video with their likeness:

- Use Dreamina identity: `docs/VIDEO_HOTSPOT.md`, `docs/DREAMINA.md`, `config/hotspot-identity.json`.
- Do **not** open `docs/HeyGen.md` or `docs/HeyGen_skills.md`.
- Do **not** run installed `heygen-video` / `heygen-avatar` / `heygen-translate` skills.
- Do **not** ask `generation.service` (remotion | hyperframes | heygen | dreamina).
- Only use HeyGen if the user named HeyGen this session.

Pipeline: cover `image2image` (face only) → `seedance2.0mini` `multimodal2video` (`@Image 1` cover, `@Image 2` face, `@Audio 1` timbre, spoken script in `{dialogue}`, captions in the prompt). One-off agent jobs use `npm run media:dreamina -- talking-head --spoken "..." --out videos/<id> --generation-service dreamina` (or `video:hotspot --format digital-human`). Never `text2video`. Never `multimodal2video` with only the face photo. Then publish packs. RPA needs `批准RPA` this session.
